{"id":"n71248-1-3","stage":1,"title":"아마 · 也许","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71248-1-3-1","ko":"이번 동창회에 승규가 올 수 있을까?","zh":"这次同学聚会上承奎能来吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동창회에","meaning":"校友会","explanation":"동창회：校友会；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"동창회","audio":"/audio/144b00af1ad84ad8336d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48106","senseId":"1","lemma":"동창회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"올","meaning":"来，来参加","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을까?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"144b00af1ad84ad8","term":"동창회","zh":"校友会","audio":"/audio/144b00af1ad84ad8336d.mp3","entryId":"48106","definition":"从同一个学校毕业的人们举行的聚会。","pronunciation":["동창회","동창훼"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","